# Files in this repo that must NOT be served by the live site.
#
# wrangler.jsonc serves the whole repo root ("./") as static assets. Before this
# file existed (added 2026-09-17), every tracked file was publicly downloadable
# from tanawin-menu.tanawinbnb.workers.dev — the database migrations, the Edge
# Function source, SECRETS.md, and the .git folder itself (/.git/config and
# /.git/HEAD both returned 200). Checked at the time: no secret VALUE was in any
# of it or anywhere in history, and .git/config held no credentials, so this was
# hygiene rather than a leak. Keep it that way.
#
# ⚠️ Never list anything the app itself loads: *.html, css/, js/, assets/,
# sw.js, manifest.webmanifest, offline.html. A wrong line here breaks the live
# app for guests. After ANY change to this file, deploy and curl the live site
# with a cache-buster: app files must still return 200, and the entries below 404.

.git/
docs/
db/
supabase/
scripts/
tmp/
*.md
wrangler.jsonc
.gitignore
.assetsignore
